## LeadsExportApi

### Create a request to export leads collected from a lead ad
## Create a request to export leads collected from a lead ad
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/leads_export
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "ad_id": "<string>",
 "end_date": "<string>",
 "start_date": "<string>"
}


### Get the lead export from the lead export create call
## Get the lead export from the lead export create call
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/leads_export/{{leads_export_id}}
Accept: application/json
